  'draft', 'core',
  $x$A baby born at 28 weeks' gestation is now 10 days old on the neonatal unit. She has a continuous 'machinery' murmur heard best below the left clavicle, bounding peripheral pulses, and a widened pulse pressure. She is requiring increasing respiratory support and echocardiogram confirms a large patent ductus arteriosus with significant left-to-right shunting and left atrial/ventricular dilatation.$x$,
  'What is the most appropriate first-line management?',
  array['patent ductus arteriosus','prematurity','COX inhibitors']
),
